		{"id":"3c4828b0eab9ca5e","x":-1340,"y":-826,"width":250,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"Utilisé pour démarrer plusieurs service à l'aide d'une commande"},
		{"id":"24e3f901942be0b0","x":-1340,"y":-1094,"width":250,"height":174,"type":"text","text":"mon-projet  \n\n├── nginx-1  \n\n├── web-1  \n\n└── db-1"},
		{"id":"245b1f3f3a21a09a","x":-1388,"y":-1920,"width":347,"height":705,"type":"text","text":"name: mon projet\n\n`services:`\n\t`nginx:`\n\t\t`image: nginx:alpine`\n\t\t`ports:`\n\t\t`- \"8080:80\"`\n\t`adonis:`\n\t\t`image: mon-site-adonis`\n\t\t`environment:` \n\t\t\t`DB_HOST: database`\n\t\t\t`DB_PORT: 5432`\n\t\t `depends_on:`\n\t\t `- database`\n\t`database:`\n\t\t`image: postgres:alpine`\n\t\t`environment:` \n\t\t\t`POSTGRES_DB: site_adonis`\n\t\t\t`POSTGES_USER: adonis`\n\t\t\t`POSTGRESS_PASSWORD: pwd123`\n\t\t`volumes:` \n\t\t\t`- données_postgres:/var/lib`/postgressql/data\n \nvolumes: \n\tdonnées_postgres\n"},
		{"id":"495741b7a0996508","x":-2120,"y":-1255,"width":272,"height":60,"type":"text","text":".yaml (plus modèrne) == .yml, "},
		{"id":"f12769cfec12fe08","x":-1688,"y":-826,"width":250,"height":89,"type":"text","text":"décrire comment lancer et relier un ou plusieurs containeurs"},
		{"id":"5ca3dda3ebab4ed1","x":-1760,"y":-1437,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":""},
		{"id":"727f9b94823d6d4f","x":-1715,"y":-1263,"width":250,"height":136,"type":"text","text":"compose.yaml (compose.yml et docker-compose.yml sont des anciens noms)"},
		{"id":"e5734eb5d4932baa","x":-1885,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"Fichiers"},
		{"id":"87c7d579b7bae70e","x":-2640,"y":-767,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Recette de facbication d'une image Docker perso"},
		{"id":"0e1edc7ef1eb2044","x":-2640,"y":-560,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Dockerfile"},
		{"id":"0463081e772102bc","x":-2844,"y":-1320,"width":408,"height":374,"type":"text","text":"**FROM node:22-alpine**\n(Utilise une image node avec une base alpine)\n\n**WORKDIR /app**\n(Définit /app comme le dossier de travail dans l'image)\n\n**COPY package.json package-lock.json ./**\n(Copie les fichier  )\n"}
